<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>
  <main class="page page--landing">
    <section class="landing-hero">
      <div class="landing-hero__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">A calmer way to manage money</p>
        <h1>Know where your money is going.</h1>
        <p class="landing-hero__lead">Purslip brings accounts, spending, budgets, and goals into one clear daily view.</p>
        <p class="landing-hero__note">Private by design. Built for your real financial life.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="landing-hero__visual" aria-label="Purslip dashboard preview">
        <div class="landing-orb landing-orb--one"></div>
        <div class="landing-orb landing-orb--two"></div>
        <div class="landing-preview">
          <div class="landing-preview__top"><span>Net worth</span><strong>▦</strong></div>
          <strong class="landing-preview__amount">Your overview</strong>
          <span class="landing-preview__change">Clearer money decisions</span>
          <div class="landing-preview__bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="landing-features" aria-label="Purslip features">
      <article class="card landing-feature"><span class="landing-feature__icon">◒</span><h2>See the whole picture</h2><p>Accounts, transactions, and net worth in one reliable overview.</p></article>
      <article class="card landing-feature"><span class="landing-feature__icon">⌁</span><h2>Make plans that stick</h2><p>Use budgets and goals to turn your intentions into visible progress.</p></article>
      <article class="card landing-feature"><span class="landing-feature__icon">✦</span><h2>Stay in control</h2><p>Import your data, export it anytime, and keep ownership of your story.</p></article>
    </section>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
